# Source for the TZif fixtures in this directory. See README.md for the
# generating command.
#
# Each zone has one historical transition in 1950 and then hands the whole
# modern era to its trailing POSIX TZ footer, which is what a slim tzdata
# build does for real zones and what this repository's development machine
# (fat tzdata, transitions to 2499) otherwise never exercises.

# --- fixed offset, no DST rules in the footer -----------------------------
Zone	Fixture/Fixed	6:30	-	LMT	1950
			7:00	-	FIX

# --- northern hemisphere: DST runs Mar..Nov, US-style rules ---------------
Rule	FIXN	1950	max	-	Mar	Sun>=8	2:00	1:00	D
Rule	FIXN	1950	max	-	Nov	Sun>=1	2:00	0	S

Zone	Fixture/North	-4:30	-	LMT	1950
			-5:00	FIXN	F%sT

# --- southern hemisphere: DST window wraps the year end -------------------
Rule	FIXS	1950	max	-	Oct	Sun>=1	2:00	1:00	D
Rule	FIXS	1950	max	-	Apr	Sun>=1	3:00	0	S

Zone	Fixture/South	9:30	-	LMT	1950
			10:00	FIXS	G%sT
